      "@id": "processes/kg/kg-separation.bpmn#provenance-7",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "proposal",
      "cat-harness:section": "task Task_CutoverCheck",
      "prov:value": "Six conditions, each decided by an existing gate and none assumed: every declared layer mounted at its pin; every path a declaration names resolves (`check:declaration-resolution` — directories, assets, visualisers, needs); no wiring still names the monorepo (`livesAt`, a submodule, a reusable workflow, a path into the old checkout — lessons 15 and 16); no import or reference against the layer order; and the site builds from the mounts alone.",
